            "x": 64,
            "y": -224,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 192,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nNeeds Lime Webhooks on the server (included in Lime CRM Cloud) and an API user that is an administrator or a member of the **Webhook Users** group. The trigger subscribes to `company.delete` when the flow starts; the Wait gives the subscription time before the provoking action. Do not remove it. Lime Webhooks delivers once by default (no retries), so a delivery lost by the network fails the run."
        }
